@crew lemaire-nils
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Lemaire, Survey, nights. I carry samples. One day I'll name a star.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hi, {me}. Why did the comet skip breakfast? It was running late. Sorry.   #funny
- {hi}, {me}. Sweep tonight. I'll be the one carrying the boxes.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. You laughed at the comet joke. Nobody laughs at the comet joke.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good night! Dr. Sato said my labels were "acceptable". I'm framing that.   #funny
? mood:low
- No joke today. Bad night. Tomorrow's will be twice as bad, to make up.
== near
? act:breakfast
- Karin's joke today was worse than mine. I'm furious. And proud.   #funny
? habit:music
- Music room, then sleep. Night shift lives backwards. It works, mostly.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I ran a market stall on the Ostrander colonies. I still sell ideas. Nobody buys.   #funny
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- My list of star names. For stars nobody's found yet. Somebody has to be ready.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 3: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, bye, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about, life)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}! What do you call a lazy star? A... no. Wait. I'll fix it.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}. You've missed four jokes. I can tell them all now. No? Later, then.   #funny

== bye
- {bye}. If you spot a new star, tell me first. I've got names ready.

== near
? habit:gardener
- I help in the garden before shift. Plants don't groan at my jokes. They just grow.   #funny
? place:lounge
- Bow lounge. Big windows. I look for the gaps where a star should be.

== invite
- Observatory night? Bring a name. If we find a star, you can have first go.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Friday jam? I'll tell a joke between songs. That's my instrument.   #funny

== accept
- Yes! Good. I'll prepare a joke for the walk there.   #funny
- Yes, please. I'll be there. Early, for once.

== decline
- Not tonight. Night sweep. Boxes to carry. Another time?
? weekday:sun|mon
- Rest day. I'm calling home. Mum still laughs at my jokes. Tuesday?

== missed
- You missed it. And a joke. The joke was bad. You were lucky.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! Why did the cake go to space? It wanted a launch. Sorry.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Karin told me a good joke as a present. It hurt. It was good.   #funny

== cue
? cue:tradition.observatory
- Last night I found a gap on the chart. Probably nothing. I wrote a name down anyway.

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? No joke. Promise. Well. Maybe one.

== about
? aff:yilmaz-karin:friend
- Karin's jokes are worse than mine. That's the nicest thing I can say. I mean it nicely.   #funny

== life
? tier>=friend
- I carry the boxes now. One day it'll be my name on the chart. I'm patient. Mostly.
